# Patchfile to de-tune Si570 on the ZCU102 board for QPLL-based White Rabbit
#
# The 125M reference clock needs to be tuned to approx. 200ppm *below* the
# center frequency, as the QPLLs can only tune (400ppm) in a single direction.
#
# Author(s)  : David Epping <david.epping@missinglinkelectronics.com>
#              (based on work by Tomasz Wlostowski <tomasz.wlostowski@cern.ch>)
# Company    : Missing Link Electronics
#              CERN

